 534:         # DECLARED-ABSENT IS NOT MISSING, AND NEITHER IS A PASS (2026-08-17).
 535:         #
 536:         # 51 pages needed a JavaScript crash fixed -- a present harm to a reader on
 537:         # their second visit -- and fail two PRE-EXISTING signals that nothing had
 538:         # ever checked, because this gate only inspects pages a push touches and
 539:         # nobody had touched them.
 540:         #
 541:         # The obvious way through was to add the "Provisional RoB-2 and GRADE"
