 543:         # ZERO risk-of-bias assessments. So does FINERENONE_REVIEW, WHICH PASSES THIS
 544:         # SIGNAL while printing the banner over 0 of 145 trials assessed. The signal
 545:         # is named no_rob_banner and it tests for a DISCLOSURE ELEMENT, not for an
 546:         # assessment -- and reads to everyone as though it tested the assessment.
 547:         # One more check that fails toward comfort.
 548:         #
 549:         # So: three states, not two. MISSING blocks. DECLARED-ABSENT does not block,
 550:         # and is REPORTED every run, never silently dropped -- the restore exemption
 551:         # above set that precedent and the reasoning is the same.
 552:         #
 553:         # A BANNER ALONE CANNOT BUY THE EXEMPTION. The page must ALSO be listed in
